From: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 14:01:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] scraper: set the fanart list on the video info tag

ListItem.setAvailableFanart() is deprecated since Kodi logs it
(xbmc/xbmc e830e7d778); Kodi's own copy of this scraper already calls
InfoTagVideo.setAvailableFanart(), which takes the same list.
---
 python/scraper.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/python/scraper.py b/python/scraper.py
index 965b6d8..f1f5eda 100644
--- a/python/scraper.py
+++ b/python/scraper.py
@@ -94,7 +94,7 @@ def add_artworks(listitem, artworks, IMAGE_LIMIT):
 
     fanart_to_set = [{'image': image['url'], 'preview': image['preview']}
         for image in artworks.get('fanart', ())[:IMAGE_LIMIT]]
-    listitem.setAvailableFanart(fanart_to_set)
+    infotag.setAvailableFanart(fanart_to_set)
 
 def get_details(input_uniqueids, handle, settings, fail_silently=False):
     if not input_uniqueids:
